# Offline tools of the PX4 phase (lane selection, world and marker generation, log reader and
# validator, run summaries). The ROS 2 nodes are C++ and do not use this environment.
# numpy: log arrays and statistics. opencv-contrib-python-headless: ArUco marker images.
numpy
opencv-contrib-python-headless
# pyyaml: reads the pipeline's params.yaml (cruise altitude placeholder).
pyyaml
# imageio-ffmpeg: a static ffmpeg binary (no system ffmpeg here) to encode the Phase 8 camera
# streams and the clip. pillow: draws the clip's HUD and cards.
imageio-ffmpeg
pillow
